PracticeItems.Prompt:
Consider the following code:

int count = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
    count = count + 1;
}

How many times does the line "count = count + 1;" execute?

Consider this nested loop:

for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
    for (int j = 0; j < 4; j++) {
        System.out.println("hi");
    }
}

How many total times does the println statement execute?

Consider the following loop:

int x = 10;
while (x > 0) {
    x = x - 3;
}

How many times does the statement "x = x - 3;" execute before the loop stops?
